OL,3,GNEWSAStretch of A38 closed after two
OL,4,Alorries crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the A38 in Derbyshire has been
OL,7,Fclosed following a crash involving two
OL,8,Florries.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Police said it was called to
OL,11,Fa southbound stretch of carriageway
OL,12,Fnear the Egginton junction at 15:42 BST
OL,13,Fon Tuesday.
OL,15,FThe road has been closed at the
OL,16,Fjunction while emergency services deal
OL,17,Fwith the crash.
OL,19,FThe force has advised drivers to avoid
OL,20,Fthe area and follow diversions.
